"**Description**: List FDA pharmacological drug classes (Established "
"Pharmacologic Class, EPC) and the number of drug products in each class. "
"Classes include designations like 'Selective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitor"
" [EPC]', 'Beta-Adrenergic Blocker [EPC]', 'HMG-CoA Reductase Inhibitor "
"[EPC]' (statins), 'ACE Inhibitor [EPC]', etc. Use this to discover drug "
"class names for filtering or understanding drug categorization."
msgstr ""

